  "rationale": "The notes suffer from severe repetition, poor speaker attribution, and multiple critical errors. They fail to map speaker labels (Speaker 1, Speaker 3, Speaker 4, Me) to their actual names (Rohan, Viktor, Maya, Dana) despite the cast list. The notes hallucinate the migration runbook deadline as 'October 28' instead of September 28. Furthermore, they report superseded values as final decisions and action items, specifically assigning Viktor to write the runbook (it was reassigned to Maya) and stating the rollout will start at 10% (it was explicitly reversed to 5%). Important details like Dana's escalation with Grace Obi and Viktor's reconciliation script are missing. The extreme redundancy across numerous sections severely impacts conciseness and readability."
